    "en": {
      "trackName": "Stack - Watch Tetro",
      "description": "New: Daily Challenge — everyone gets the same falling-block puzzle once a day. Build a streak, chase a best score, and check your progress by asking Siri, no phone required.\n\nDrop, match, and blast your way to a new high score in this falling-block puzzle arcade crafted for your wrist! Chase bomb power-ups, real Game Center leaderboards, and smooth Digital Crown controls — no phone needed.\n\nGameplay Highlights\n• Classic falling-block mechanics\n• Neon bomb power-ups for explosive clears\n• Daily Challenge: the same seeded puzzle for everyone, once a day\n• Real Game Center leaderboards and streak achievements\n• Smooth Digital Crown controls\n• Quick, satisfying rounds for on-the-go play\n\nDaily Challenge\nEveryone gets the same falling-block sequence once a day, so it's a fair contest, not just a high score chase. Build a streak by playing every day, see your best score and a 7-day trend, and ask Siri to check your streak without opening the app.\n\nPower-Up Fun\nCollect and activate bomb blocks to wipe rows in style with glowing effects and satisfying haptics.\n\nCompete & Conquer\nSign in to Game Center (optional) to submit your scores to a live leaderboard and unlock streak achievements. Fully playable offline without it — your scores and streak are always saved on your watch either way.\n\nDesigned for the Wrist\nFully playable on your wrist, optimized for modern watch hardware. No phone required during gameplay.",
